@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam titleFontSize 20
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
skinparam ParticipantPadding 24
skinparam BoxPadding 12
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #42566B
  LifeLineBorderColor #8295A8
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #D8EAFE
  ActivationBorderColor #42566B
  ParticipantBorderColor #42566B
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #E8F1FA
  ParticipantFontColor #172B4D
  ActorBorderColor #42566B
  ActorBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  GroupBorderColor #8295A8
  GroupBackgroundColor #F4F7FA
  GroupHeaderFontColor #172B4D
  DividerBackgroundColor #E8F1FA
  DividerBorderColor #8295A8
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFBEB
  BorderColor #BBA86A
  FontSize 12
}
hide footbox
title
UC-P04 - Cancel a Parking Reservation
<size:11>Preconditions: Student is signed in and has a parking reservation reference.</size>
end title
actor Student as ST
boundary "Student Portal" as UI
control "Parking Service" as SVC
entity "Mobility Records" as DATA

ST -> UI: Cancel parking reservation
activate UI #D8EAFE
UI -> SVC: Get cancellation summary (reservationRef)
activate SVC #D8EEDC
SVC -> DATA: Reconcile due expiry; load owned reservation and linked charging requests (studentId)
activate DATA #E2E7ED
DATA --> SVC: Current states, allocations and summary version / unavailable / retrieval error
deactivate DATA
opt owned record retrieved and not already Cancelled
SVC -> SVC: Check Confirmed, not checked in, now < expiresAt and cancellable dependents
activate SVC #D8EEDC
SVC --> SVC: Cancellable / ineligible
deactivate SVC
end
SVC --> UI: Cancellation context, existing result or explicit error
deactivate SVC
alt record missing, inaccessible or retrieval failed
UI --> ST: Generic unavailable record / read error; return to bookings or retry
else already Cancelled
UI --> ST: Show existing cancellation; do not release resources again
else owned record exists but is not cancellable
UI --> ST: Reject combined cancellation; checked-in parking uses UC-P07; resolve active dependent charging
else eligible for cancellation
UI --> ST: Review parking, dependent Pending/Scheduled requests and all allocations to release
end
deactivate UI
break record unavailable, read failed, already Cancelled or not cancellable

end

ST -> UI: Confirm or decline cancellation
activate UI #D8EAFE
alt Student declines, edits or abandons
UI --> ST: Leave all records and allocations unchanged
else Student confirms
UI -> SVC: Confirm cancellation (reservationRef, summaryVersion, operationRef)
activate SVC #D8EEDC
SVC -> SVC: Recheck session and permission
activate SVC #D8EEDC
SVC --> SVC: Current access result
deactivate SVC
alt session expired or permission denied
SVC -> SVC: Prepare authentication-required / access-denied result
activate SVC #D8EEDC
SVC --> SVC: No update attempted
deactivate SVC
else session valid and permission granted
critical Recheck and cancel parking with its dependents
SVC -> DATA: Cancel owned reservation and displayed eligible requests\nonly if now < expiresAt, states and confirmed consequences still match
activate DATA #E2E7ED
note over SVC,DATA
  Cancel parking and Pending/Scheduled dependents together;
  release their remaining holds and allocations once.
end note
DATA --> SVC: Cancelled / already cancelled / summary changed / ineligible / save failure
deactivate DATA
end
opt update outcome uncertain / response lost
SVC -> DATA: Find original parking cancellation result (operationRef, studentId)
activate DATA #E2E7ED
DATA --> SVC: Original result / still unknown
deactivate DATA
end
end
SVC --> UI: Operation outcome and accessible current details
deactivate SVC
alt access invalid
UI --> ST: Sign in if permitted; reload current records and confirm again
else outcome still unknown
UI --> ST: Outcome unconfirmed; retain operationRef and resolve original result before retry
else save failed
UI --> ST: Report failure; no partial update; retry after reload and revalidation
else summary changed but records remain cancellable
UI --> ST: No cancellation; reload updated consequences and ask for confirmation again
else record or dependent became ineligible
UI --> ST: Reject combined cancellation; no partial changes; checked-in parking uses UC-P07
else cancelled or already cancelled
UI --> ST: Show Cancelled parking and resulting linked charging statuses; no duplicate release
end
end
deactivate UI

footer Smart E-Mobility Hub | Submission 2 | Parking & Private EVs
@enduml
